    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The tech team of the  Aga Khan University Centre for Innovation in Medical Education (AKU-CIME)  recently participated in a national-level engineering exhibition - the IEEEP Fair 2024, organised by the  Institution of Electrical & Electronics Engineers, Pakistan (IEEEP) . An in-house innovation by the CIME team was submitted as an entry to the Healthcare Innovation category in which the team was awarded third prize among more than 90 entries in the category from institutions across Pakistan.",
